          "group": "other",
          "terms": [
            "AI"
          ],
          "projection": 0.0373,
          "text": "✅ AI supports our process, but people make the decisions. We will never use AI to make a hiring decision. ✅ We use AI to help, not to hide. When AI is used to support scheduling or screen resumes, it’s always reviewed by a recruiter—and we regularly check for fairness, bias, and accuracy."
        },
