          "label": "process_logistics",
          "group": "other",
          "terms": [
            "AI"
          ],
          "projection": 0.0313,
          "text": "We love and use AI every day at HubSpot, but we deploy it where it makes sense. We use AI to remove friction from the process so our recruiters can focus on what really matters: meaningful conversations with candidates. Our goal is to enhance the human experience, not automate it. Because the AI landscape is changing fast, we’re committed to learning, evolving, and staying transparent along the wa"
        },
